=== Zero-Copy Trit Stream IPC Demo ===

Creating SWCNT trit stream channel:
  Sender PID:   1
  Receiver PID: 2
  Channel: physical SWCNT path allocated

--- Zero-Copy Mechanism ---
  Sender writes trit +1:
    → Sets current direction to +54 µA on SWCNT
    → Receiver reads +54 µA = trit +1
    → SAME physical current. Zero copy.

  Sender writes trit 0:
    → No current on SWCNT (photon off)
    → Receiver reads 0 µA = trit 0
    → No data moved. True zero.

  Sender writes trit -1:
    → Sets current direction to -54 µA on SWCNT
    → Receiver reads -54 µA = trit -1
    → SAME physical current, opposite direction.

--- Word Transmission (27 trits) ---
  Sending word: 42
  Transmitted as 27 sequential trit current pulses
  Latency for 10µm channel: ~12.5 ps (Fermi velocity)

--- Channel Revocation ---
  Closing channel: cease photon delivery
  Effect: instant, one clock cycle, physical disconnect
  No buffer flush, no FIN packet, no handshake

=== Stream demo complete ===
